 [:db/cas 17592186423501 :question/problem "![](images/12/1252844f7a9e2fb2ca0ff1d2e2e1546a460e7d0846b4ae2996b6ce984ee305a1.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,\\frac{1}{4}\\le u\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le v\\le \\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the top side of $Δ$ under the action of $T$ is a line segment. Which of the following statements are true regarding the image?\n\nI. The image makes the angle of $0$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nII. The image makes the angle of $\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nIII. The endpoints of the image lie on the circles of radii $\\frac{1}{4}$ and $1$ centered at $O.$" "![](images/12/1252844f7a9e2fb2ca0ff1d2e2e1546a460e7d0846b4ae2996b6ce984ee305a1.png)\n\nConsider the square region $Δ$ in the $uv$-plane, given by\n\n$$\nΔ=\\{(u,v)\\,:\\,\\frac{1}{4}\\le u\\le 1,\\,\\,0\\le v\\le \\frac{5\\pi }{12}\\},\n$$\n\nand the transformation $T,$ given by\n\n$$\nT:(u,v)\\to (u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v).\n$$\n\nThe image of the top side of $Δ$ under the action of $T$ is a line segment. Which of the following statements are true regarding the image?\n\nI. The image makes the angle of $0$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nII. The image makes the angle of $\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ with the positive $x$-axis.\n\nIII. The endpoints of the image lie on the circles of radii $\\frac{1}{4}$ and $1$ centered at $O.$\n\nSelect all that apply."]
